# Vendored runtime

`scripts/aem.js` is the Edge Delivery runtime. Do not edit it.

Call `createOptimizedPicture` from a block. Pass the authored `alt` through. Do not remove the `alt` attribute afterward. A missing attribute fails WCAG 1.1.1. `alt=""` means decorative.

If a change seems to require editing this file, stop and say so. The fix belongs in the block.
